f3a455f77043bdbcec51c85d16c11d05a65","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#AQUAMARINE#With the Mouth's death its crawler also falls lifeless on the ground!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#AQUAMARINE#当大嘴怪死去时，它的爬虫也毫无生机的倒在了地上！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"908c17c18b36c4575913131d40cb86a3621ecde38626062ca0e3a25a21379f1a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26725ed7cf17564ac1159242f25c650385efbb1d0770cb884308139f3b45b650","logical_entry_identity":"57cd6c021e49d4a1bfced16c38ec5d4f63d731dd5265dd458995a9db2283bd32","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your arcane abilities have been interfered with!\n\nEyal is a torn world, and the forces of nature can react strongly to the arcane energies that seek to manipulate them. Some items and areas are imbued with anti-magic, a natural energy that disrupts magical abilities and effects. There are even those who have learned to harness anti-magic into their own wild abilities, and who use them to hunt down and destroy those who practise magic. So beware, caster! It is a hostile world ye wander in.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你的奥术能量被干扰了！\n\n埃亚尔是一块被撕裂的大陆，自然力量对奥术能量反应激烈，试图彻底控制它。某些物品和地方被灌输了反魔力量，这是一种能干扰魔法能力和魔法效果的自然力量。甚至还有一些人，将反魔力量和他们本身的自然力量结合起来，用于猎捕并摧毁魔法使用者。小心，施法者！你漫游的世界并不友好。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a81e9394058d48cd1c91a162cfdf1abca2baf9ef4bf6f3897606fce8ff9b669c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"267b106eb21764aede721da92c76399be75fb9f038e06c0bb5cc2cc2d9aeebda","logical_entry_identity":"ed9e05f9e5245a781df4b5bb22cb865490a044c92671953cebe4cc82b6150826","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"generic life regeneration","source_tag":"entity name","target":"通用 生命值回复"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c1b4cc043793bb87395fe6ab735fd587928135b486710261216505726eb82673","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"267f42f675c4aebf4de6f0bad2116ed99188c15c4d70d4d2fae5eb00fc25c4ad","logical_entry_identity":"e38bc411d340694a0a85dd177d51fc972d28d39ab43c125669daaf2ab9afa3e1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Instantly grow a moss circle of radius %d at your feet.\n\t\tEach turn the moss deals %0.2f nature damage to each foe within its radius.\n\t\tThis moss is very thick and sticky causing all foes passing through it have their movement speed reduced by %d%% and have a %d%% chance to be pinned to the ground for 4 turns.\n\t\tThe moss lasts %d turns.\n\t\tMoss talents are instant but place all other moss talents on cooldown for 3 turns.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在你的脚下，半径 %d 的范围内生长出苔藓。\n\t\t每回合苔藓对半径内的敌人会造成 %0.2f 点自然伤害。\n\t\t这种苔藓又厚又滑，所有经过的敌人的移动速度会被降低 %d%%，并有 %d%% 概率被定身 4 回合。\n\t\t苔藓持续 %d 个回合。\n\t\t苔藓系技能无需使用时间，但会让同系其他技能进入 3 回合的冷却。\n\t\t伤害受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"38ee488573b808157519a92922ed7c23114a4607500d86491619d30f2637b41c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26810d4ad1d5424396be40ddf74c581e1e600d76619c6546e343595f14282855","logical_entry_identity":"98914bc96dfbbabeedff09a0122b642846ec7928e898737e8b90c5682d6b3755","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s pulls %s %s around %s like a dark shroud!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s将%s%s环绕%s，形成了黑暗的壁障"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fcd780a2388860fc50a0b418179a0f77f3c31d5ac64e3dfbc58d1ce9331dc890","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26863c1225ad76e6570ab28fa3781fc01e0a0c4318507d205abca7c89b7861b6","logical_entry_identity":"4be06f7813050bd854286cc868be79c2d48e8222286245587546e16bec37c130","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Runes 2","source_tag":"_t","target":"符文2"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d1f2e5f7059938c548da8f04845f00307301b49027d9461d4bdd9b33121c498","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"268f0c1033201c03e293cb57c3449c18c64da3725b866fc34059e448270d4cb0","logical_entry_identity":"0b074adbf0079b53902a9c583e45c9ee7450cb2d4278b130a5bb9a8923847698","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Eternal Warrior","source_tag":"_t","target":"-永恒战士"},{"args_order":null,"